#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:65 3182ded9efdf45f19fea19567acfa1b2
msgid "Installing AirSim"
msgstr "安装 AirSim"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:67 923d491f635b460fa5d23345ef756ce5
msgid ""
"`Binaries <https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/releases>`__ are available"
" for AirSim for Windows and Linux platforms, ``v1.3.0`` and later have "
"support for Copter and Rover included. Binaries are a quick and easy way "
"to test out the features without installing Unreal Engine, etc. Just "
"download the precompiled environments and run to get started immediately."
" Many different types of environments are available, some notable ones "
"include LandscapeMountains, City and Neighbourhood."
msgstr ""
"AirSim 的 Windows 和 Linux 平台 `二进制文件 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/releases>`__ 已发布，``v1.3.0`` "
"及更高版本已包含对 Copter 和 Rover "
"的支持。二进制文件是无需安装虚幻引擎即可快速测试功能的简便方式，只需下载预编译环境并运行即可立即开始。提供了许多不同类型的环境，其中值得注意的包括"
" LandscapeMountains、City 和 Neighbourhood。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:69 36b4fbb2c6f7471b9eb6932d293fab33
msgid ""
"If you're using the binaries, then you can directly skip to `Using AirSim"
" with ArduPilot <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-airsim.html"
"#using-airsim-with-ardupilot>`__ section. Also see `this Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/use_precompiled.md"
"#dont-have-good-gpu>`__ for some useful commandline options to improve "
"the performance."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是二进制文件，可以直接跳到 `将 AirSim 与 ArduPilot 配合使用 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-airsim.html#using-airsim-with-"
"ardupilot>`__ 章节。另请参阅 `此 Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/use_precompiled.md"
"#dont-have-good-gpu>`__ 获取一些有用的命令行选项以提高性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:71 3bcb929a194a4fa09cc5a1400501353e
msgid ""
"For development and testing out new features, you'll have to build AirSim"
" from source. The setup instructions for building from source are "
"described below."
msgstr "对于开发和测试新功能，需要从源码构建 AirSim。从源码构建的设置说明如下。"

