" `该页面的 FAQ "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#faq>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:80 477cc903c6d54407bb9bf29fdd44cb4b
