"构建 AirSim - 按照 `AirSim 设置上的步骤 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md"
"#build-airsim>`__ 安装 Visual Studio 软件包并克隆 AirSim。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:84 6621fac3da5b4c91a5a7ed3ab13f1114
msgid ""
"Run ``build.cmd`` from the command line. This will create ready to use "
"plugin bits in the ``Unreal\\Plugins`` folder that can be dropped into "
"any Unreal project."
msgstr "从命令行运行 ``build.cmd``。这将在 ``Unreal\\Plugins`` 文件夹中创建可以直接放入任何虚幻项目的插件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:89 7198f58541f74682a8d3111707ac5ea0
