msgstr ""
"AirSim 的 Linux 和 MacOS 设置页面在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md>`__，如有问题请查看"
" FAQ。请注意，仅支持 MacOS **Catalina（10.15）**。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:93 ccdc8365ecdb4c6fb2a1252a6c6a7c49
msgid ""
"`Build Unreal Engine "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md"
