#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:116 95f7966294df4e2b9f1c786b84d19baa
msgid ""
"Finally, you will need an Unreal project that hosts the environment for "
"your vehicles. AirSim comes with a built-in \"Blocks Environment\" which "
"you can use, or you can create your own."
msgstr "最后，您需要一个承载飞行器环境的虚幻项目。AirSim 内置了「Blocks 环境」供您使用，或者您也可以创建自己的环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:118 cc6dd25e38d84aec8c312f7290c467a8
msgid ""
"Blocks is not a very highly detailed environment to keep the repo size "
"reasonable but it's useful for various testing all the times and it is "
"the easiest way to get your feet wet in this strange land."
msgstr "Blocks 不是一个非常精细的环境（为了保持仓库大小合理），但它适合各种测试，也是在这个陌生领域入门的最简单方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:120 a2b3ea6862de46d397eb02f999ceb571
msgid ""
"See AirSim's `Blocks Setup page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__"
" for running the environment."
msgstr ""
"参阅 AirSim 的 `Blocks 设置页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__"
" 以运行该环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:122 40e7a03fa11c4a7fb6f305232e660a68
msgid ""
"For using another environment, check the information at the end of the "
"page."
msgstr "关于使用其他环境，请查看页面末尾的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:127 47de7040c4444fd4bfa3ce9e98ccbb3e
msgid "Using AirSim with ArduPilot"
msgstr "将 AirSim 与 ArduPilot 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:129 130ae833bd7c439f91cccf4d1f0b1308
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have :ref:`setup ArduPilot SITL <dev:building-the-"
"code>`, completed the Unreal Environment setup or have the binaries "
"downloaded and verified that both are working individually before "
"proceeding. If you aren't familiar with SITL, see :ref:`Examples of using"
" SITL <dev:sitl-examples>`."
msgstr ""
"在继续之前，请确保已 :ref:`设置 ArduPilot SITL <dev:building-the-"
"code>`，完成虚幻引擎环境设置或下载了二进制文件，并验证两者单独运行均正常。如果不熟悉 SITL，请参阅 :ref:`使用 SITL 的示例 "
"<dev:sitl-examples>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:133 c468e4bc4f284b5a9ced5dec5a0c8ffe
msgid ""
"Running in UE Editor: Go to ``Edit->Editor Preferences``, in the "
"``Search`` box type ``CPU`` and ensure that the ``Use Less CPU when in "
"Background`` is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"在 UE 编辑器中运行：进入 ``Edit->Editor Preferences``，在 ``Search`` 框中输入 "
"``CPU``，确保取消勾选 ``Use Less CPU when in Background``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:137 020f3a1043164e248678eaf21adf7274
msgid ""
"If you're using Windows Subsystem for Linux 2 to run ArduPilot and AirSim"
" under Windows, please see https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2019"
"-airsim-simulator-support-for-ardupilot-sitl-part-ii/46395/5 on how to "
"connect them."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用 Windows Subsystem for Linux 2 在 Windows 下运行 ArduPilot 并将 AirSim 也在 "
"Windows 下运行，请参阅 https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2019-airsim-"
"simulator-support-for-ardupilot-sitl-part-ii/46395/5 了解如何连接它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:140 ccb67ee9960141a29c78ee9645203923
msgid ""
"`AirSim's settings.json file "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/settings.md>`__ "
"specifies the vehicle and its various properties. See the page for the "
"options available."
msgstr ""
"`AirSim 的 settings.json 文件 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/settings.md>`__ "
"指定了飞行器及其各种属性。可用选项请参阅该页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:142 17b6183b494a47c29ab411ade416be8a
msgid ""
"It's stored in at the following places- Windows: ``Documents\\AirSim``, "
"Linux: ``~/Documents/AirSim``"
msgstr "该文件存储在以下位置——Windows：``Documents\\AirSim``，Linux：``~/Documents/AirSim``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:144 33cc423fcd0d4a88910cfa290d956d92
msgid ""
"The file is in usual JSON format. On the first startup, AirSim would "
"create ``settings.json`` file with no settings."
msgstr "该文件为标准 JSON 格式。首次启动时，AirSim 会创建一个不含任何设置的 ``settings.json`` 文件。"

