#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:178 307e81cb479646d1b6296f0d8d412826
msgid ""
"Earlier, ``SitlPort`` was used in place of ``ControlPort`` in the "
"settings. This change is applicable in the latest AirSim master & "
"binaries `v1.3.0` and later. The update is backwards-compatible so even "
"if you're using ``SitlPort``, it'll work."
msgstr ""
"此前，设置中使用 ``SitlPort`` 代替 ``ControlPort``。此更改适用于最新的 AirSim master 和 "
"`v1.3.0` 及更高版本的二进制文件。该更新向后兼容，即使您使用的是 ``SitlPort`` 也仍然有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:180
#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:235 49972b156e5541cbb4b42de0e5d72ef9
#: 9aca88c360cb4723860c4651715d370c
msgid "First launch AirSim, after that launch the ArduPilot SITL using"
msgstr "首先启动 AirSim，然后使用以下命令启动 ArduPilot SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:188 e655ab6663914591a86da2ef9e044632
msgid ""
"Initially, the editor will hang after pressing the Play button if the "
"ArduPilot SITL hasn't been started (this is due to Lock-Step Scheduling)."
" Run `sim_vehicle.py` and it should go back to normal."
msgstr ""
"最初，如果 ArduPilot SITL 尚未启动，按下 Play 按钮后编辑器将会卡死（这是由于锁步调度机制）。运行 "
"`sim_vehicle.py` 后应恢复正常。"

