msgid ""
"`AirSim's APIs document "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/apis.md>`__ "
"explains the different APIs available and their usage."
msgstr ""
"`AirSim API 文档 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/apis.md>`__ 介绍了各种可用"
" API 及其用法。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:504 20ec6ebdbfc248129d4c0880c4070374
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot vehicles don't support controlling the movement "
"through the AirSim APIs, however any method of controlling the movement "
"which connects directly to ArduPilot rather than using AirSim’s API work,"
" examples include DroneKit & ROS with Mavros."
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 飞行器不支持通过 AirSim API 控制运动，但任何直接连接到 ArduPilot（而不是使用 AirSim "
"API）的运动控制方式均可使用，例如 DroneKit 和带 Mavros 的 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:506 924599a1c20a4f16b7a831db1d766031
msgid ""
"The `Image APIs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/image_apis.md>`__ "
"have been tested to work with Copter, for some ready-to-run sample codes,"
" see the files in ``PythonClient/multirotor`` such as ``opencv_show.py``."
" Also, any APIs which are are used to fetch information about the "
"environment, and interact with it, or even collect sensor information "
"will work."
msgstr ""
"`图像 API "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/image_apis.md>`__ "
"已测试可与 Copter 配合使用，一些现成的示例代码请参阅 ``PythonClient/multirotor`` 中的文件，如 "
"``opencv_show.py``。此外，用于获取环境信息、与环境交互或收集传感器信息的任何 API 均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:508 b70bd4254c2a4abbbcf0159e049b4b7e
msgid ""
"A ROS wrapper has also been added. See `airsim_ros_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_ros_pkgs.md>`__"
" for the ROS API, and `airsim_tutorial_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_tutorial_pkgs.md>`__"
" for tutorials. Note that limitations of controlling vehicle movement "
"exist here as well."
msgstr ""
"还添加了 ROS 封装。ROS API 请参阅 `airsim_ros_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_ros_pkgs.md>`__，教程请参阅"
" `airsim_tutorial_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_tutorial_pkgs.md>`__。请注意，这里同样存在控制飞行器运动的限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:512 3ed65fc719fc42498c7827e1d53e2b1c
msgid ""
"Not all the APIs have been tested with Copter, if you find things that "
"don't work or would like to have them supported, please let us know"
msgstr "并非所有 API 都已与 Copter 测试，如果发现不可用的功能或希望获得支持，请告知我们。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:517 077f410cf4f64eed9a245ecf1d548bc4
