msgid "Change the following in the ``settings.json`` file:"
msgstr "在 ``settings.json`` 文件中进行以下更改："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:521 de966b46466345dd973888539fd3b7cb
msgid ""
"``UdpIp`` to the IP address of the machine running ArduPilot (Can be "
"found using ``ipconfig`` on Windows, ``ifconfig`` on Linux.)"
msgstr ""
"将 ``UdpIp`` 更改为运行 ArduPilot 的机器的 IP 地址（Windows 上使用 ``ipconfig``，Linux 上使用"
