#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:522 207a2763fae34c889433fd93e1f303b2
msgid ""
"``LocalHostIp`` to the IP address of the current machine which is running"
" AirSim, specific to the network adapter being used such as Ethernet or "
"WiFi. Can be set to ``0.0.0.0`` to receive messages on all networks"
msgstr ""
"将 ``LocalHostIp`` 更改为运行 AirSim 的当前机器的 IP 地址，具体取决于所使用的网络适配器（以太网或 "
"WiFi）。可以设为 ``0.0.0.0`` 以接收所有网络上的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:525 66d56c6e8d6c4ca78a851bce62608f60
msgid ""
"Use ``-A`` argument in ``sim_vehicle.py`` (passes the arguments following"
" it to the SITL instance), followed by ``--sim-address`` to specify "
"Airsim's IP address"
msgstr ""
"在 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 中使用 ``-A`` 参数（将其后的参数传递给 SITL 实例），然后使用 ``--sim-"
"address`` 指定 AirSim 的 IP 地址。"

