#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:540 e999454979f24921900fa11dbd9619f0
msgid "Using different ports"
msgstr "使用不同的端口"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:542 359e88a4d766431888bd0a38121db3db
msgid ""
"``UdpPort`` denotes the port no. which ArduPilot receives the sensor data"
" on (i.e. the port that Airsim sends the data to)"
msgstr "``UdpPort`` 表示 ArduPilot 接收传感器数据的端口号（即 AirSim 发送数据的目标端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:544 5dd95d94686849089555d8b48cc17ca9
msgid ""
"``ControlPort`` assigns the motor control port on which Airsim receives "
"the rotor control message"
msgstr "``ControlPort`` 指定 AirSim 接收旋翼控制消息的电机控制端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:546 92a391b05d1847358f47214bf6f92fcc
msgid ""
"``--sim-port-in`` should be equal to sensor port i.e. port specified in "
"``UdpPort``"
msgstr "``--sim-port-in`` 应等于传感器端口，即 ``UdpPort`` 中指定的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:547 de908ff669a14e1bb5bb6ba154cb9c29
msgid ""
"``--sim-port-out`` should be equal to motor control port i.e. port "
"specified in ``ControlPort``"
msgstr "``--sim-port-out`` 应等于电机控制端口，即 ``ControlPort`` 中指定的端口。"

